{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.Mathlib.StandardYoungCountInstance","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.Mathlib.StandardYoungCountInstance","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:QOU.Mathlib.HeckeAlgebra","lean:module:QOU.Mathlib.RSKBridge"],"declarations":2,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mathlib.StandardYoungCountInstance.dim_eq_dimSYT","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mathlib.StandardYoungCountInstance.dim_eq_dimSYT","kind":"theorem","line":51,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mathlib/StandardYoungCountInstance.lean#L51-L53","doc":"The instance really does carry the SYT count, not some other dimension function. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mathlib.StandardYoungCountInstance.instStandardYoungCount","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mathlib.StandardYoungCountInstance.instStandardYoungCount","kind":"instance","line":41,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mathlib/StandardYoungCountInstance.lean#L41-L49","doc":"**The canonical standard-Young-tableau count.**\n\n`dim := dimSYT` with the Burnside/RSK identity discharged by `RSK_substrate_proved`.  This is the\nfirst inhabitant of `StandardYoungCount`; before the carrier was restated it had none, and one\ncould not have been meaningful — the old `Prop`-valued field would have let any instance nominate\nits own claim. ","signatureChunk":0}]}